# Media — never commit source or intermediate audio.
# Kept in step with AUDIO_EXTENSIONS in worker/index.js. Every format the relay
# will accept from a recorder is a format that must never be committable, or a
# file left in a working copy becomes a published recording. An ignore list that
# is narrower than the accept list leaves exactly that gap.
*.wav
*.m4a
*.mp3
*.mp4
*.ogg
*.oga
*.opus
*.aac
*.flac
*.3gp
*.amr
*.weba
*.aiff
*.aif
*.caf
*.wma
*.m4b
*.mov
*.mkv
*.webm

# Secrets / local environment
.env*

# Model weights and embeddings. The voice embedding is the one that matters:
# a 192-float vector is enough to recognise the speaker, and it is stored as a
# secret for that reason, so it must not be committable either.
*.npy
*.pt
*.bin
*.onnx
*.safetensors
*.ckpt
*.h5
pretrained_models/
embedding*.json
*embedding*.json

# Tooling
node_modules/
.wrangler/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
